{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Vessel.</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/f0261867190d2c1fa35080b4c94633f1.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/f0261867190d2c1fa35080b4c94633f1.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/f0261867190d2c1fa35080b4c94633f1.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><br><strong>Try different Abilities without restraints. </strong>Test their upgrades.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/081d19ec6876a6eeafb97ffe33fc7f27.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/081d19ec6876a6eeafb97ffe33fc7f27.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/081d19ec6876a6eeafb97ffe33fc7f27.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br>  <br><strong>Team up.  Take down bosses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cooperative boss-rush experience built for action. <br>Fight solo or alongside up to three friends with seamless teamwork, every encounter is a test of reflexes, coordination, and built-up knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/6dbcf32da83996ef488a31442d339303.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/6dbcf32da83996ef488a31442d339303.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/6dbcf32da83996ef488a31442d339303.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, choose from a selection of powerful upgrades to enhance your character\u2019s abilities, buff yourself or your team.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/70f8b37fe74d6a351b1ca8d4346503bd.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/70f8b37fe74d6a351b1ca8d4346503bd.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/70f8b37fe74d6a351b1ca8d4346503bd.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Accidentally</strong>&quot; kill your friends while they're distracted by the new shiny gear. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/86d6f75459fa1b2fa88ccb7c769563d5.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/86d6f75459fa1b2fa88ccb7c769563d5.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/86d6f75459fa1b2fa88ccb7c769563d5.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die. Learn. Try again.</strong><br>Dodge telegraphed attacks, use abilities wisely, and master raid-like mechanics that reward teamwork and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/811a32704d5476387b1d1ef44714f1c6.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/811a32704d5476387b1d1ef44714f1c6.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/811a32704d5476387b1d1ef44714f1c6.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordinate, or fall apart.</strong><br>Only the synchronized survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/dd4f6f32739f0bbb73f40df8a9663160.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/dd4f6f32739f0bbb73f40df8a9663160.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/dd4f6f32739f0bbb73f40df8a9663160.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die some more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each defeat is an opportunity to improve, sharpen your timings, flow, and push deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/5f801650ea68af15e74d791aba8dc703.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/5f801650ea68af15e74d791aba8dc703.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/5f801650ea68af15e74d791aba8dc703.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:<br>- Play alone or with up to 3 other friends online (4 players total);<br>- Defeat 20+ unique bosses, in different stages;<br>- 5 difficulties;<br>- Over 100 unique items to loot and improve your Vessel;<br>- Slap your friends;<br>- Multiple Abilities with 5 upgrades each to try out, with more coming;<br>- Banish items you don't want to encounter during a run;<br>- Upgrade your Soul, improving your stats with any Vessel;<br>- Vessel customization;<br>- Spectate others when you die, or revive them as the carry you are;</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Act 1 - Novice +","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/d4664654768a28555ed0b5f863bda6dcfead2426.jpg"},{"name":"Act 2 - Novice +","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/e5a2a205bf679412d128e18e4f756a4f1fd0a667.jpg"},{"name":"Act 3 - Novice +","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/5e13296800a9e67d2416a7609cc8f68c6479f90f.jpg"},{"name":"Act 4 - Novice +","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/b680983dd6370e1af12aa379e38619f9971e9b7a.jpg"},{"name":"Act 1 - Elite +","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/dfcfb7795ab47008ffa7190a0f890241d7d3f45f.jpg"},{"name":"Act 2 - Elite +","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/b1bf2363e4a8f13a2fc0aee8bff9b21d14de7708.jpg"},{"name":"Act 3 - Elite +","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/81ea4bb92075659e16b0f681f54417ea8747eb61.jpg"},{"name":"Act 4 - Elite +","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/0a7fe33339770e1437a46597956de2bd97d0ce6f.jpg"},{"name":"Just A Coin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/383c24dc7121c06d6f3ddc961f115c418c0656b5.jpg"},{"name":"Half Way There (But Not Really)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867960/33ab585e13e43f7d0e844aca563f0131d688a1bc.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867960?t=1774619409","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867960?t=1774619409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/542648e1e1a9aa78ddcff2cd1301ff07f29352a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774619409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/542648e1e1a9aa78ddcff2cd1301ff07f29352a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774619409","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Vessel.</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l