like mechanics that reward teamwork and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/811a32704d5476387b1d1ef44714f1c6.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/811a32704d5476387b1d1ef44714f1c6.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/811a32704d5476387b1d1ef44714f1c6.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordinate, or fall apart.</strong><br>Only the synchronized survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/dd4f6f32739f0bbb73f40df8a9663160.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/dd4f6f32739f0bbb73f40df8a9663160.webm?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/dd4f6f32739f0bbb73f40df8a9663160.mp4?t=1774619409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die some more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each defeat is an opportunity to improve, sharpen your timings, flow, and push deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/5f801650ea68af15e74d791aba8dc703.poster.avif?t=1774619409\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets